# Build context = services/ (see Dockerfile header). Applies to EVERY service
# image built from the unified Dockerfile. Keeps secrets, caches, tests, and
# local-dev cruft out of the images — the Dockerfile stage comments assume this
# file exists ("Excludes: tests/, __pycache__, .git, *.pyc").

# Python bytecode / build / type-checker caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Secrets & local env — NEVER bake into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests & local smoke scripts (e.g. case_review/test.py)
**/tests/
**/test.py
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py

# VCS & editor metadata
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
